  "answer_input_mode": "answer.txt only",
  "answer": "Yes. For Non-English submissions, arXiv requires a multi-language abstract: an English abstract must be provided in addition to the abstract in the original language of the submission. The separator between the multiple abstracts is a line consisting of five hyphens: ----- (with a blank line before and after the '-----' separator line), as documented in arXiv's official FAQ 'Submissions in Languages Other Than English and Multiple-Language Submissions' (info.arxiv.org/help/faq/multilang.html). Note: under arXiv's current policy (effective 11 Feb 2026), the entire paper must also be provided in English, with the English version appearing first.",
